## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

Do NOT:
- Run `terraform apply` in Session 1
- Create real cloud resources
- Hardcode account IDs, ARNs, or CIDR blocks meant to be variables
- Skip any module from `plan/architecture/overview.md`
- Use inconsistent placeholder patterns across modules
- Automatically start Session 2 implementation
- Skip session summary documentation
